</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/ee9d549a-5410-11f1-8a39-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/AP26140189874871.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/ee9d549a-5410-11f1-8a39-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/AP26140189874871.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">784d3920-751e-11f1-935d-1bff2aa3277d</guid><pubDate>Wed, 01 Jul 2026 08:11:27 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/ee9d549a-5410-11f1-8a39-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/AP26140189874871.jpg">Alexander Kazakov/Pool Sputnik K - Alexander Kazakov</source><dc:creator>古莉</dc:creator></item><item><category>亚洲</category><title>日本首相高市早苗从7月1日开始访问印度</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E4%BA%9A%E6%B4%B2/20260701-%E6%97%A5%E6%9C%AC%E9%A6%96%E7%9B%B8%E9%AB%98%E5%B8%82%E6%97%A9%E8%8B%97%E4%BB%8E7%E6%9C%881%E6%97%A5%E5%BC%80%E5%A7%8B%E8%AE%BF%E9%97%AE%E5%8D%B0%E5%BA%A6</link><description>
